  "description": "<p>Welcome guests with a personalized Christian doormat featuring an uplifting Bible verse. This doormat combines faith-based design with practical home utility, making it a special addition to any entryway. It's designed to offer warmth and scripture, creating a welcoming atmosphere for your home.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalizable with family name, initial, or custom text alongside a Bible verse</li>\n<li>Features inspirational scripture-based designs to reflect faith and values</li>\n<li>Made from high-quality polyester fabric and memory stretch sponge for comfort</li>\n<li>Easy to clean with simple methods for spills, solids, or deeper cleaning</li>\n<li>Suitable for use both indoors and outside covered doorways</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Christian, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Faux Wool, Polyester fabric, Memory stretch sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Suede</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Gently soak with dry duster cloth for spilled liquid, use hand-held vacuum/broom/shake off for solid waste, wipe with damp cloth and mild soap for deeper cleaning, or flush with garden hose</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is ideal for entrances, front porches, and entryways, providing a welcoming touch. It can be used both indoors as a decorative accent or outdoors under a covered area to greet visitors with warmth and scripture.</p>",
